## Using This Checklist

**Before you start**:
- Review the checklist to understand what "done" means
- Note any items that require tool setup or access

**During execution**:
- Check off items as you complete them
- Flag any items you skip with a reason

**Before finishing**:
- Ensure all applicable items are checked
- Document any deviations or skipped items
- Run any automated verification commands

## Completion Criteria

Work is considered complete when:
- All applicable checklist items are verified
- All automated checks pass (tests, linters, etc.)
- Documentation reflects any deviations
- Output meets the stated acceptance criteria
